<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Projects on sunbeng</title><link>https://sunbeng.eu/projects/</link><description>Recent content in Projects on sunbeng</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><managingEditor>alles.mil@gmail.com (Alexander Miller)</managingEditor><webMaster>alles.mil@gmail.com (Alexander Miller)</webMaster><copyright>Copyright (c) 2026, Alexander Miller</copyright><atom:link href="https://sunbeng.eu/projects/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Mechanical Keyboards</title><link>https://sunbeng.eu/projects/mechanical-keyboards/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:54:01 +0100</pubDate><author>alles.mil@gmail.com (Alexander Miller)</author><guid>https://sunbeng.eu/projects/mechanical-keyboards/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This is my collection of mecanical keyboards.&#10;I may be willing to sell if you make me an offer.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="quisan-magicforce-68"&gt;Quisan Magicforce 68&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://sunbeng.eu/projects/mechanical-keyboards/quisan-magicforce.jpg"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;img src="https://sunbeng.eu/projects/mechanical-keyboards/quisan-magicforce_hu_b01ec4f389e3c000.jpg" alt="Quisan Magicforce 68"&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Keyboard: Quisan Magicforce 68&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Switches: Outemu Brown (stock)&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Keycaps: Tai-Hao Miami&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Deskmat for GMK Infernal by &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/sandun_keycap_artist/?hl=en"&gt;Sandun&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="vortex-cypher"&gt;Vortex Cypher&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a href="https://sunbeng.eu/projects/mechanical-keyboards/vortex-cypher.jpg"&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;img src="https://sunbeng.eu/projects/mechanical-keyboards/vortex-cypher_hu_ca8b1da514419cee.jpg" alt="Vortex Cypher"&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/a